OL,3,GNEWSAWho are your representatives in
OL,4,Athe House of Keys?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople on the Isle of Man have chosen
OL,7,Ftheir political representatives in the
OL,8,FHouse of Keys for the next five years.
OL,10,FThursday's election saw a total of 82
OL,11,Fcandidates vie for the two seats
OL,12,Favailable in each of Isle of Man's 12
OL,13,Fconstituencies.
OL,15,FThe make-up of the new house includes
OL,16,Fnine returning Members of the House of
OL,17,FKeys (MHKs) and 15 newcomers. Seven of
OL,18,Fthe 24 are women, there are two members
OL,19,Fof political parties, and the House of
OL,20,FKeys will have its youngest ever
OL,21,Fmember.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
